<div
  class="has-base-background-color wp-block-uw-blocks-uw-accordion"  id="95bd66a5-4d99-489b-ac1e-0e0c2b64955a"
  data-wp-context='{"uuid":"95bd66a5-4d99-489b-ac1e-0e0c2b64955a","isOpen":false,"headingSlug":"what-is-a-learning-community"}'  data-wp-init="callbacks.initAccordion"
  data-wp-watch="callbacks.watchAccordion"
  data-wp-class--active="context.isOpen"
  >
	<h2 class="accordion-heading">
	<button aria-expanded="false"
    id="95bd66a5-4d99-489b-ac1e-0e0c2b64955a-accordiongroupid"
    class="accordion-trigger"
    type="button"
    data-wp-bind--aria-expanded="context.isOpen"
    aria-controls="sect-95bd66a5-4d99-489b-ac1e-0e0c2b64955a"
    data-wp-on--click="actions.toggleOpen"
    >
        <svg width="16" height="9" viewBox="0 0 16 9" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M8.74219 8.6951C8.33346 9.10163 7.67252 9.10163 7.26813 8.6951L0.306555 1.77535C-0.102182 1.36881 -0.102182 0.711437 0.306555 0.309227C0.715292 -0.0929842 1.37623 -0.0973091 1.78062 0.309227L7.99864 6.49375L14.221 0.304901C14.6297 -0.101634 15.2907 -0.101634 15.6951 0.304901C16.0995 0.711437 16.1038 1.36881 15.6951 1.77102L8.74219 8.6951Z" fill="#121212"/>
        </svg>
        What is a Learning Community?	</button>
	</h2>

	<div class="accordion-body-wrapper"
    id="sect-95bd66a5-4d99-489b-ac1e-0e0c2b64955a"
    role="region" aria-labelledby="95bd66a5-4d99-489b-ac1e-0e0c2b64955a-accordiongroupid">
		<div class="accordion-body">
			<div class="is-layout-constrained">
				

<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Some residence halls host <a href="https://www.housing.wisc.edu/residence-halls/learning-communities/">learning communities</a>. A learning community can have additional programming, classes taught right in the residence hall, or a specialized focus. UW–Madison is a big place, and living in a learning community can help you have a smaller, more personalized experience.</p>

			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>


<div
  class="has-base-background-color wp-block-uw-blocks-uw-accordion"  id="06eda368-85bc-4f48-ac73-3c7d69ffb42a"
  data-wp-context='{"uuid":"06eda368-85bc-4f48-ac73-3c7d69ffb42a","isOpen":false,"headingSlug":"is-any-short-term-housing-available"}'  data-wp-init="callbacks.initAccordion"
  data-wp-watch="callbacks.watchAccordion"
  data-wp-class--active="context.isOpen"
  >
	<h2 class="accordion-heading">
	<button aria-expanded="false"
    id="06eda368-85bc-4f48-ac73-3c7d69ffb42a-accordiongroupid"
    class="accordion-trigger"
    type="button"
    data-wp-bind--aria-expanded="context.isOpen"
    aria-controls="sect-06eda368-85bc-4f48-ac73-3c7d69ffb42a"
    data-wp-on--click="actions.toggleOpen"
    >
        <svg width="16" height="9" viewBox="0 0 16 9" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M8.74219 8.6951C8.33346 9.10163 7.67252 9.10163 7.26813 8.6951L0.306555 1.77535C-0.102182 1.36881 -0.102182 0.711437 0.306555 0.309227C0.715292 -0.0929842 1.37623 -0.0973091 1.78062 0.309227L7.99864 6.49375L14.221 0.304901C14.6297 -0.101634 15.2907 -0.101634 15.6951 0.304901C16.0995 0.711437 16.1038 1.36881 15.6951 1.77102L8.74219 8.6951Z" fill="#121212"/>
        </svg>
        Is any short-term housing available?	</button>
	</h2>

	<div class="accordion-body-wrapper"
    id="sect-06eda368-85bc-4f48-ac73-3c7d69ffb42a"
    role="region" aria-labelledby="06eda368-85bc-4f48-ac73-3c7d69ffb42a-accordiongroupid">
		<div class="accordion-body">
			<div class="is-layout-constrained">
				

<p class="wp-block-paragraph">For the fall semester, it’s usually possible to move into the residence halls early for an additional fee. Consult with University Housing prior to arrival.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Madison Friends of International Students (MFIS) can sometimes arrange <a href="https://www.mfismadison.org/temp-homestay">homestays</a> for incoming exchange students for 2-3 nights upon arrival.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">There are several <a href="https://info.wisc.edu/plan-your-visit/#lodging">on-campus options</a> for short-term accommodations, and a huge number of hotels located throughout the city.</p>

			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>


<div
  class="has-base-background-color wp-block-uw-blocks-uw-accordion"  id="a6a89cbd-fd81-43cc-86a0-0abdc962e5ff"
  data-wp-context='{"uuid":"a6a89cbd-fd81-43cc-86a0-0abdc962e5ff","isOpen":false,"headingSlug":"can-you-give-me-more-information-on-how-renting-works-in-the-united-states"}'  data-wp-init="callbacks.initAccordion"
  data-wp-watch="callbacks.watchAccordion"
  data-wp-class--active="context.isOpen"
  >
	<h2 class="accordion-heading">
	<button aria-expanded="false"
    id="a6a89cbd-fd81-43cc-86a0-0abdc962e5ff-accordiongroupid"
    class="accordion-trigger"
    type="button"
    data-wp-bind--aria-expanded="context.isOpen"
    aria-controls="sect-a6a89cbd-fd81-43cc-86a0-0abdc962e5ff"
    data-wp-on--click="actions.toggleOpen"
    >
        <svg width="16" height="9" viewBox="0 0 16 9" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M8.74219 8.6951C8.33346 9.10163 7.67252 9.10163 7.26813 8.6951L0.306555 1.77535C-0.102182 1.36881 -0.102182 0.711437 0.306555 0.309227C0.715292 -0.0929842 1.37623 -0.0973091 1.78062 0.309227L7.99864 6.49375L14.221 0.304901C14.6297 -0.101634 15.2907 -0.101634 15.6951 0.304901C16.0995 0.711437 16.1038 1.36881 15.6951 1.77102L8.74219 8.6951Z" fill="#121212"/>
        </svg>
        Can you give me more information on how renting works in the United States?	</button>
	</h2>

	<div class="accordion-body-wrapper"
    id="sect-a6a89cbd-fd81-43cc-86a0-0abdc962e5ff"
    role="region" aria-labelledby="a6a89cbd-fd81-43cc-86a0-0abdc962e5ff-accordiongroupid">
		<div class="accordion-body">
			<div class="is-layout-constrained">
				

<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Please check out the <a href="https://www.tenantresourcecenter.org/">Tenant Resource Center</a>, a Madison-based nonprofit organization, for more advice and details on rentals. The Tenant Resource Center also has a <a href="https://www.tenantresourcecenter.org/get_help">UW campus office</a>.</p>

			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>
